# The sample documents are files, not source.
#
# Git must not rewrite their line endings on the way out. The desk states each
# one's exact byte count as a literal, so that laying out the first frame needs
# no file system read, and a checkout that turned every newline into two would
# make every one of those numbers wrong, on one platform only.
assets/documents/* -text
assets/brand/* -text
assets/fonts/* -text
test/goldens/* -text
